            <p style={{ marginTop: 18, fontSize: 15, lineHeight: 1.6, color: "#CBD8CC", maxWidth: 320 }}>
              A reading room that learns your shelf. Read, keep a record of what moved you, and let the catalog quietly build the next stack for you.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div className="mono" style={{ fontSize: 11, color: "#8CA593", lineHeight: 1.8 }}>
            24 titles &middot; 8 genres <br/>
            content&#8209;based recommendation engine <br/>
            no data leaves this session
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style={{ padding: "44px 36px" }}>
          <div style={{ display: "flex", gap: 0, marginBottom: 28, borderBottom: "1px solid #D9CBA6" }}>
            <button onClick={() => { setMode("login"); setError(""); }} className="mgn-navlink" style={{ color: mode === "login" ? "#1F3A2E" : "#9C8B63", borderBottom: mode === "login" ? "2px solid #B8894A" : "2px solid transparent" }}>
              Log In
            </button>
            <button onClick={() => { setMode("signup"); setError(""); }} className="mgn-navlink" style={{ color: mode === "signup" ? "#1F3A2E" : "#9C8B63", borderBottom: mode === "signup" ? "2px solid #B8894A" : "2px solid transparent" }}>
              Join the Library
            </button>
          </div>

